Package: npcompete
Title: Competition and Density Metrics for Nonprofit Markets
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jesse", "Lecy", , "jdlecy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds measures of competition in local nonprofit markets,
    including the Herfindahl-Hirschman Index, normalized HHI, concentration
    ratios, the Kwoka index, Gini coefficients and population-adjusted
    density, by geography, subsector and year.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://nonprofit-open-data-collective.github.io/npcompete/,
    https://github.com/Nonprofit-Open-Data-Collective/npcompete
BugReports: https://github.com/Nonprofit-Open-Data-Collective/npcompete/issues
